# Contact Us

## Logic Riddle – Cow Puzzle Game

We would love to hear from you!

If you have questions, feedback, suggestions, or experience a problem while playing **Logic Riddle – Cow Puzzle Game**, please contact our support team.

### Game Support

For technical problems, gameplay issues, bugs, or questions about the game, please email us:

**[wordsexplorergamesupport@gmail.com](mailto:wordsexplorergamesupport@gmail.com)**

### Feedback & Suggestions

Your feedback helps us improve the game.

You can contact us with suggestions for:

* New levels
* Gameplay improvements
* New features
* Bug reports
* General feedback
* Other questions about the game

### Reporting a Problem

When contacting support, please include a short description of the issue.

If applicable, you can also include:

* Your device model
* Operating system version
* Game version
* Steps to reproduce the problem
* Screenshots of the issue

This information can help us investigate and resolve problems more quickly.

We will review your message and respond as soon as reasonably possible.

